      "widgets_values": [
        "Global Metadata: Instrumental funk-pop and hip-hop dance groove, 120 BPM target, 4/4 meter, bright confident playful mood, clean punchy studio production. A compact forty-second dance instrumental with a steady audible pulse throughout. No rubato, no long ambient intro, no fadeout before forty seconds.\nVocal Details: Strictly instrumental. No lead vocal, no singing, no rap, no spoken words, no humming, no vocal samples.\nArrangement: Tight dry kick on a steady four-beat pulse, crisp snare backbeats, closed eighth-note hi-hats, syncopated electric bass, short clean rhythm-guitar chops, warm electric-piano stabs. Enter the full drum groove within the first two seconds. Maintain a stable groove with small fills at eight-bar boundaries and a little lift in the middle. Keep the drums and bass clearly audible, with enough rhythmic space for grounded step-touch street dancing.",
